# XPCCoding inlining-annotation allowlist
#
# Each non-comment line must have this tab-separated form:
#
# Sources/XPCCoding/path/File.swift:line:@annotation<TAB>measured rationale
#
# Supported annotations are @inlinable, @usableFromInline, and
# @inline(__always). Line numbers are intentional: moving or editing an
# allowlisted cluster requires review and an updated benchmark rationale.
#
# Retained annotations are limited to measured hot leaves and their
# compiler-required ABI closure. See reference/InliningPolicy.md.

